                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "9000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "orders",
                                "1"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "TraceIdResponseFilter 把 Micrometer MDC 中的 traceId 写入响应头；网关原样透传下游响应头。拿到后可在 Zipkin UI 直接打开完整调用链（gateway→order→user 共 4 个 span）。"
